":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}]},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/map(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/map(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/map(_:)","type":"topic","abstract":[],"title":"map(_:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"map","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">((","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}]}}}